"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 462,
"char_end": 512,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 46.444,
"end": 52.031,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Honestly, the increased speed comes from braking earlier and more gently, not from taking more risks.",
"char_start": 531,
"char_end": 632,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 52.031,
"end": 54.409,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 633,
"char_end": 676,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 54.409,
"end": 58.226,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 677,
"char_end": 746,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 58.226,
"end": 59.806,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 763,
"char_end": 794,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 59.806,
"end": 62.355,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 795,
"char_end": 845,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 62.355,
"end": 62.882,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 864,
"char_end": 874,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 62.882,
"end": 67.943,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than minor suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 875,
"char_end": 971,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 67.943,
"end": 71.897,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "The setup is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 972,
"char_end": 1047,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 71.897,
"end": 73.18,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 1064,
"char_end": 1086,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 73.18,
"end": 76.096,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1087,
"char_end": 1137,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 76.096,
"end": 82.678,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1156,
"char_end": 1271,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 82.678,
"end": 85.082,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
